--And now, to announce them!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.500
--This year, ringing the Lovely Bell
and pledging their eternal love...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.040
--Robby!
--This year, ringing the Lovely Bell
and pledging their eternal love...

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.080
