--This year, ringing the Lovely Bell
and pledging their eternal love...

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.040
I'm fine!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.500
...the Lovely King

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.330
and Lovely Queen are...

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.290
I'm not fine!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.750
What?!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:43.040
<i>I </i>was going to be the one to ring
the bell with Robby! You'll pay!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:53.040
