--♪ eternal love ♪

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:12.080
--♪ Eternal love ♪
--♪ Eternal love ♪

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.540
Hey you, the idiot couple down there,
hurry and get aboard!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.450
It's Ikku!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.790
Robby! Wait up!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.370
Um, you dropped this.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.750
Th-Thanks.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:46.080
You like Isekangaroo, too? So do I.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:53.000
Why?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.290
Tell me why!

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.160
--Mr. Yang...
--Mr. Yang...

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:08.540
♪ It's all right, if you believe
in your dreams ♪

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:15.200
