Damn, that was an awful planet.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.750
Really. Damn awful.

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.660
Wait a minute, I'm finally able to say it!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.500
I can spout as much complaining,
abusive language, and negativity as I like!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.660
